# .stale-refs-allow — file paths (ERE) exempt from the stale-reference audit.
# This repo DOCUMENTS the stale patterns (it's the audit's home), so its own
# README/CHANGELOG necessarily contain them; the audit script + workflow are
# already self-exempt by name.
(^|/)README\.md$
(^|/)CHANGELOG\.md$
(^|/)docs/history/
